  "marketing_title_raw": "Men's 18k Yellow Gold & 1.45ct Natural Sapphire Hand Engraved ROCOCO design Ring \n\n ANZOR'S EXCLUSIVE \"Patent Pending\"",
  "short_name": "Men's 18k Yellow Gold ROCOCO design Sapphire Ring",
  "long_description_raw": "Why Pay Full Retail Ever Again? Buy Direct from the Manufacturer.\nA magnificent 18k Solid Yellow Gold ROCOCO design European Style hand-made ring, round cut, genuine 6.5mm, 1.45ct blue sapphire is a substantial ring. \nRococo is derived from the French word rocaille, originally meaning the bits of rocky decoration sometimes found in 16th-century architectural schemes.\nThis will make a distinct impression on your hand.\nExperience it in person, It's WAY a lot better than what you see it from the Picture.\nThis is a brand new item and is manufactured on our premises in New York City's Diamond District.\nNOTE: Each ring is made to order so your size will be the rings original. 1/4 and 1/2 sizes are available. Please specify your ring size at checkout.\nChoose White, Yellow, or Rose Gold, No extra charge. Also available in Platinum, please ask for a price quote. \nSizes available: 7 to 14 in full, half & quarter sizes.\n (price may change with selected size)\n shipped within 2-3 business days of funds clearance.\nAvailable in any Stone you prefer. Please ask for the Price,\n A Company Appraisal is included with your purchase.\nAGI Appraisal Available: Value $4,800.00 + $75\n Retail Replacement and Appraisal Value $4,800.00\nOrder By Phone: 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.\n 1.800.548. 0411. or 1 917.488.1146 \n100% Satisfaction Guaranteed.\nOur Warranty: 5 (five) Years on Workmanship! \nQuestions? 1-800-548-0411 & 1-212-921-0247",
